WEBVTT

00:00:07.082 --> 00:00:09.143
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> Louisa, time to get up.

00:00:09.196 --> 00:00:12.735
<v><b>Louisa:</b></v> OK. What time is it?

00:00:12.756 --> 00:00:15.698
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> It’s half past seven. Breakfast is at eight.

00:00:15.928 --> 00:00:17.677
<v><b>Louisa:</b></v> Is it a nice day?

00:00:17.818 --> 00:00:19.897
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> Let’s see.

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:30.667
Louisa, quick! Come here! Look at that!

00:00:30.994 --> 00:00:32.370
<v><b>Louisa:</b></v> What is it?

00:00:32.402 --> 00:00:33.853
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> Look! Over there.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.222
<v><b>Louisa:</b></v> Where?

00:00:35.247 --> 00:00:38.563
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> There. In the loch. There! Can’t you see?

00:00:39.001 --> 00:00:42.830
There’s something in the loch. It’s moving.

00:00:43.312 --> 00:00:44.389
Can you see it now?

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:47.098
<v><b>Louisa:</b></v> Yes. What is it?

00:00:47.159 --> 00:00:50.166
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> I don’t know. Quick take a photo.

00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:59.073
<v><b>Louisa:</b></v> I can’t see it now. Can you?

00:00:59.085 --> 00:01:05.049
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> No, I can’t. I can’t see anything now. Let’s see those photos, Louisa.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.646
Wow! I don’t believe it. Look at that…